---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="Orbwalker"
  lines={["Orbwalker"]}
  dek="A fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile, with free orb movement."
  description="Orbwalker is a fantasy match-3 roguelike for mobile, with free orb movement and build-driven runs."
  image="/img/orbwalker.jpg"
>
  <section class="sys read">
    <div class="row">
      <dl class="facts" data-rise>
        <div><dt>Genre</dt><dd>Match-3 roguelike</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>Mobile</dd></div>
        <div><dt>Status</dt><dd>Playable on itch.io</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <div class="body">
        <figure data-rise><img src="/img/orbwalker.jpg" alt="Orbwalker title screen" width="720" height="405" /></figure>
        <p data-rise>You drag one orb anywhere on the board, and every orb it passes moves out of the way.</p>
        <p data-rise>A run is a string of fights, shops and relics. You pick up upgrades as you go, and enemies show their next move so you can plan around it.</p>
        <div class="shots" data-rise>
          <img src="/img/orbwalker-combat.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker combat" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
          <img src="/img/orbwalker-shop.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker shop" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
          <img src="/img/orbwalker-relic.jpeg" alt="Orbwalker relic choice" loading="lazy" width="490" height="1080" />
        </div>
        <p data-rise>I built it on my own, from an empty project to a playable game, in three months.</p>
        <p data-rise><a href="https://rajahafify.itch.io/orbwalker" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Play it on itch.io</a> or <a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/yOek_scKUMY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">watch the short</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
